WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.601 --> 00:00:01.735
[onscreen voices]

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:04.705
- [slurps]

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:07.074
MM-MM. MM-MM.

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:08.175
COME ON, MAN,
WHAT YOU DOIN', MAN?

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.910
THAT'S STUPID.

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:12.312
THAT'S STUPID, MAN,
DON'T DO THAT, MAN. COME ON.

00:00:12.346 --> 00:00:16.316
- ARE YOU KIDDING ME?

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.353
DO NOT GO INTO
A CRANE SHOT RIGHT NOW!

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:20.420
YOU KIDDING ME?

00:00:20.454 --> 00:00:22.055
- YEAH, MAN, I HEAR Y'ALL.

00:00:22.089 --> 00:00:25.492
THIS MOVIE'S GOT
A INCONSISTENT VISUAL LANGUAGE!

00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:27.561
- HALF THE TIME, THIS [bleep]
JUST SHOOTIN' ALL HAND-HELD

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.930
LIKE HE
A DOGMA FILMMAKER!

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:30.998
THAT'S FUNNY,

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.533
SINCE DOGMA
CLEARLY FORBIDS

00:00:32.566 --> 00:00:34.401
TEMPORAL AND GEOGRAPHICAL
ALIENATION!

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:35.903
[sudden music strike]

00:00:35.936 --> 00:00:38.272
- OH, I LOVED THAT SHOT
THE FIRST TIME.

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:40.541
WHEN IT WAS IN <i>NOSFERATU!</i>

00:00:40.574 --> 00:00:42.209
- [laughs]
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:43.510
- I MEAN, THIS [bleep]
TRYIN' TO DO SOME HOMAGE

00:00:43.544 --> 00:00:45.579
TO THE GERMAN EXPRESSIONISTS
OR SOME [bleep].

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.281
- IT'S A VISUAL
MEDIUM, MAN!

00:00:47.314 --> 00:00:50.617
ENOUGH WITH THIS <i>MY DINNER
WITH ANDRE</i> BULL[bleep]!

00:00:50.651 --> 00:00:52.519
- I MEAN, HAS THIS DUDE
EVEN HEARD OF <i>MISE-EN-SCENE?</i>

00:00:52.553 --> 00:00:55.255
PUT SOME INFORMATION
UP IN THE FRAME, BITCH!

00:00:55.289 --> 00:00:58.091
- OH, I GET IT. YEAH.
I'MA OVEREXPOSE THE FILM.

00:00:58.125 --> 00:00:59.626
- MM-HMM, MM-HMM.
- GET AN ETHEREAL LOOK.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:00.694
MAN, [bleep] THIS [bleep]!

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.462
- CAN WE JUST GO?

00:01:02.496 --> 00:01:05.732
- HOLD ON, HONEY, THEY'RE
ACTUALLY MAKING GOOD POINTS.

00:01:05.766 --> 00:01:08.235
[onscreen voices]

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.240
HEY, HAS THIS GUY WATCHED TOO
MUCH QUENTIN TARANTINO OR WHAT?

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:15.175
- SIR, WE'RE GONNA NEED YOU
TO LOWER YOUR VOICE.

00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:20.314
TOO MUCH TALKING, OKAY?
THANK YOU.

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:30.090
- THANK YOU.

